<http://data.silknow.org/object/644c03c9-c7d4-3f9e-8e1f-876d4ceeb399/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Corset made of pink satin trimmed with black machine-made lace through which is threaded with a dark pink satin ribbon. The corset is a short hip length dipping to a point over the stomach in front. It fastens with loops and studs in the centre front, and has an eyelet and matching cord adjustment at the centre back. There are bust and hip gores, and the corset is medium boned. It is machine-stitched, bright pink edged and hand-flossing, with metal slot-and-stud fastenings."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/644c03c9-c7d4-3f9e-8e1f-876d4ceeb399> .

